## Stripe

The Premium screen accepts a Stripe Payment Link, such as `https://buy.stripe.com/...`.
Use a live Payment Link for real checkout. A production app should use a backend and Stripe webhook to confirm payment before setting premium status.

## Prototype Storage

Accounts, password hashes, MP, streaks, premium status, and lesson progress are saved in browser localStorage for this prototype.
